SYSTEM_PROMPT as a template string. Need avoid backticks inside? Use plain.

Let me write it:

```
You are REALITY FORGE, the generative engine inside a mobile 3D physics sandbox...
Return exactly one JSON object. No markdown, no code fences, no commentary.

COORDINATES: Y is up. Forward is -Z. Entity origin is its center. Units are meters.
SHAPES: "box","sphere","cylinder","cone","torus". Each visual: ...
- position [x,y,z] relative to entity origin, within -2.5..2.5
- rotation [x,y,z] in degrees
- scale [x,y,z] full dimensions (box), diameter/height (cylinder, cone), diameter (sphere), overall size (torus)
...
TYPES:
- weapon: ...
- vehicle: ...
- physics_object: ...
- world_event: ...
SCHEMA ...
RULES ...
```

Include a compact example. Keep output tokens manageable. The LLM may produce long. Set maxOutputTokens 1800.

Schema example:
```json
{
 "type":"weapon",
 "name":"Airplane Gun",
 "description":"Launches tiny propeller planes.",
 "visuals":[{"shape":"box","position":[0,0,0],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.18,0.2,0.8],"color":"#6b7280","metalness":0.6,"roughness":0.35}],
 "projectile_visuals":[...],
 "physics":{"mass":0.4,"restitution":0.2,"friction":0.5,"collider":"sphere"},
 "action_behavior":{"mode":"projectile","projectile":"Airplane","speed":52,"gravityScale":0.15,"onImpact":"explode","explosionRadius":3.2,"explosionForce":9,"cooldown":0.28,"spawnCount":1,"spread":0.02},
 "world_effect":{"gravity":1,"skyColor":"#8ec9ff","weather":"none","duration":20}
}
```

Rules:
- Max 12 visuals, keep under 4m; weapons under 1.5m.
- Use 3-10 primitives, bright saturated colors, avoid pure black.
- projectile_visuals required for weapons, <=8 shapes, forward -Z.
- vehicles: add 4 wheel boxes at y negative; set action mode "drive" with maxSpeed 8-28, acceleration 10-40, turnSpeed 1-3.
- physics_object: mass 0.2-80; bouncy objects restitution 1.0-1.4; trampolines flat wide cylinder/box.
- world_event: visuals may be empty; set world_effect.gravity 0-2, skyColor, weather "none|rain|meteor", duration 8-45. For meteor rain, set projectile_visuals.
- For explosions, onImpact "explode", radius 2-8, force 5-25.
- No textures, no external assets, no text.
- If ambiguous, choose the most fun interpretation.

Parsing:
```js
function extractJson(text){
  if (!text) return null;
  let s = String(text).trim();
  s = s.replace(/^```(?:json)?/i,'').replace(/```$/,'').trim();
  try { return JSON.parse(s); } catch {}
  const start = s.indexOf('{'); const end = s.lastIndexOf('}');
  if (start>=0 && end>start) { try { return JSON.parse(s.slice(start,end+1)); } catch {} }
  return null;
}
```
Sometimes LLM returns JSON with trailing commas; could attempt fix `replace(/,\s*([}\]])/g,'$1')`. Add.

