Wait: the weapon visuals are designed pointing -Z. The player faces -Z. Weapon mount is at right hand with no rotation, so -Z is forward. Good. But from third-person camera behind, we see the back of the gun. Fine.
- Maybe rotate gun slightly outward: `g.rotation.y = -0.12`? Keep.
